{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-chebyshev-degree-genus","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:chebyshev-degree-genus","kind":"lemma","title":"Chebyshev degree equals Seifert genus for $T_{2,p}$","proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-chebyshev-degree-genus"],"tags":["chebyshev","seifert-genus","torus-knot","hecke-recurrence"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.chebyshev_degree_genus","text":"chebyshev-degree-genus.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:chebyshev-degree-genus\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_n \\in \\mathbb{Z}[s]</code> be the Hecke recurrence <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_{n+1} = s\\,a_n + a_{n-1}</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_0 = 0</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_1 = 1</code>, and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u = s^2</code>. For odd <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n = p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\deg_u a_p = (p-1)/2 = g(T_{2,p})</code>, and the leading coefficient of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_p</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u</code> is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/chebyshev-degree-genus.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"7.11.9"}
